{"kind":"html","caption":"把“第 k 大”转换为升序下标 n-k，示例中目标下标是 6-2=4。用快速选择只对目标所在的一侧继续分区：枢轴 4 落在下标 3 后，舍弃左侧；随后枢轴 5 落在下标 4，直接得到答案。每轮分区只扫描当前区间，期望时间复杂度为 O(n)，若要求严格最坏 O(n)，可用中位数的中位数来选择枢轴。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数组中的第 K 个最大元素</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .panel { margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .formula { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; }\n  .code { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 12px; }\n  .accent { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .status { margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .array { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .cell { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; text-align: center; transition: .35s; }\n  .value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .index { margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .tag { min-height: 12px; margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .cell.active { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.pivot { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .cell.target { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.discard { opacity: .32; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 4px; border: 1px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 3px; vertical-align: -1px; }\n  .dot.fill { background: #0e639c; }\n  .progress { height: 3px; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 3px; background: #3c3c3c; }\n  .bar { width: 0; height: 100%; background: #3794ff; }\n  .result { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .result strong { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>快速选择：只保留目标所在区间</h1>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      <span>输入 <span class=\"code\">[3, 2, 1, 5, 6, 4]</span></span>\n      <span><span class=\"code\">k = 2</span></span>\n      <span>升序目标下标 <span class=\"accent code\">n-k = 6-2 = 4</span></span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n    <div id=\"array\" class=\"array\" aria-label=\"快速选择过程\"></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span><i class=\"dot\"></i>当前搜索区间</span>\n      <span><i class=\"dot fill\"></i>枢轴或目标</span>\n      <span>淡化区域已被排除</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"result\">判断规则：枢轴下标小于目标下标，就只查右侧；大于目标下标，就只查左侧；相等时答案是 <strong>5</strong>。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    {\n      values: [3,2,1,5,6,4], left: 0, right: 5, pivot: -1, target: 4,\n      text: '第 2 大对应升序下标 4。先在整个数组中寻找它。',\n      labels: ['', '', '', '', '目标下标', '']\n    },\n    {\n      values: [3,2,1,5,6,4], left: 0, right: 5, pivot: 5, target: 4,\n      text: '选择 4 为枢轴，扫描当前区间：小于 4 的元素放左边，其余放右边。',\n      labels: ['', '', '', '', '目标下标', '枢轴 4']\n    },\n    {\n      values: [3,2,1,4,6,5], left: 0, right: 5, pivot: 3, target: 4,\n      text: '分区完成，枢轴 4 落在下标 3。因为 3 < 4，目标一定在右侧。',\n      labels: ['', '', '', '枢轴下标 3', '目标下标', '']\n    },\n    {\n      values: [3,2,1,4,6,5], left: 4, right: 5, pivot: 5, target: 4,\n      text: '舍弃下标 0～3，只处理 [6, 5]。选择 5 为新枢轴。',\n      labels: ['', '', '', '', '目标下标', '枢轴 5']\n    },\n    {\n      values: [3,2,1,4,5,6], left: 4, right: 5, pivot: 4, target: 4,\n      text: '再次分区后，枢轴 5 正好落在目标下标 4，查找结束。',\n      labels: ['', '', '', '', '命中：答案 5', '']\n    }\n  ];\n\n  const arrayEl = document.getElementById('array');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const barEl = document.getElementById('bar');\n  let current = 0;\n  const duration = 2300;\n\n  function render(stepIndex) {\n    const step = steps[stepIndex];\n    statusEl.innerHTML = '<span class=\"accent\">步骤 ' + (stepIndex + 1) + ' / ' + steps.length + '</span>　' + step.text;\n    arrayEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n    step.values.forEach((value, index) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      if (index >= step.left && index <= step.right) cell.classList.add('active');\n      else cell.classList.add('discard');\n      if (index === step.pivot) cell.classList.add('pivot');\n      if (stepIndex === steps.length - 1 && index === step.target) cell.classList.add('target');\n\n      const valueEl = document.createElement('div');\n      valueEl.className = 'value';\n      valueEl.textContent = value;\n      const indexEl = document.createElement('div');\n      indexEl.className = 'index';\n      indexEl.textContent = '下标 ' + index;\n      const tagEl = document.createElement('div');\n      tagEl.className = 'tag';\n      tagEl.textContent = step.labels[index] || '　';\n\n      cell.append(valueEl, indexEl, tagEl);\n      arrayEl.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n\n    barEl.style.transition = 'none';\n    barEl.style.width = '0%';\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n      barEl.style.transition = 'width ' + duration + 'ms linear';\n      barEl.style.width = '100%';\n    }));\n  }\n\n  render(current);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(current);\n  }, duration);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
